{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "lfoplus",
 "version": "0.5",
 "title": "LFO+: new waves and slow speeds",
 "description": "22 new LFO waves after RND on the WAVE knob, each with its own picture on the LFO page (audio and MIDI tracks): PLS pulse, STP staircase, TRP trapezoid, BMP double bump, FIN shark fin, BNC bouncing ball, then 16 shapes from the Jomox Alphabase: DIP HSU HSD DCY GRW SFL BWL NTC TSQ TTH DBV ZIG SEQ CHS NSE SPK. Four slower speeds after 2k on the audio tracks' MULT knob: /2 /4 /8 /16 in time with the tempo, then the same four free-running.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Cere, made with Claude",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitakt-mk1",
  "product": "Digitakt mk1",
  "os": "1.54",
  "syx_sha256": "f78ba80fa7b1da5fb0e1ff61ad61e9e71aafe79f4364fc49679f3651353e3cf6",
